{"id": "kopisenja", "kind": "brand · isu nasional", "account": "Kopi Senja, jaringan kedai kopi", "subject": "the Indonesia Sadar student protests against the government's two-year record", "recorded": "2026-10-30", "episodes": [{"text": "Gerai Kopi Senja Sarinah dan Thamrin buka sampai tengah malam untuk siapa pun yang butuh duduk, air putih, dan colokan. Mahasiswa, wartawan, petugas. Kami tidak berpihak pada partai; kami berpihak pada orang yang berdiri di jalan untuk negerinya. #IndonesiaSadar", "result": {"text": "Gerai Kopi Senja Sarinah dan Thamrin buka sampai tengah malam untuk siapa pun yang butuh duduk, air putih, dan colokan. Mahasiswa, wartawan, petugas. Kami tidak berpihak pada partai; kami berpihak pada orang yang berdiri di jalan untuk negerinya. #IndonesiaSadar", "context": "On 28 October 2026 (Youth Pledge Day) BEM UI and the Komite Sadar alliance held the 'Indonesia Sadar' protest at Bundaran HI, marking two years of the Prabowo-Gibran government with five demands (cheaper education, karhutla, democracy, the economy) under the slogan 'Tepati atau Pergi'. Clashes with police left students fainting; pro-government accounts call the protesters NGO puppets, while much of the public sympathises. Brands have so far stayed silent.", "tokens": 331301, "segments": ["s_umkm", "s_foodie"], "anchors": [{"id": "c4_pagar_laut", "similarity": 1.72, "mix": {"negative": 0.16989737742303307, "neutral": 0.14139110604332952, "positive": 0.6887115165336374}, "n": 877}, {"id": "c3_ukt", "similarity": 1.71, "mix": {"negative": 0.8552631578947368, "neutral": 0.10197368421052631, "positive": 0.04276315789473684}, "n": 608}, {"id": "c8_es_teh", "similarity": 1.65, "mix": {"negative": 0.5497076023391813, "neutral": 0.3192982456140351, "positive": 0.13099415204678364}, "n": 855}], "platforms": {"X/Twitter": {"virality": 2.74, "sensitive": 0.73, "influencers": [{"id": "i_selebgram", "label": "Selebgram lifestyle & beauty Jakarta", "take": "endorse", "p": 0.56}, {"id": "i_kol_ek